            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Relieves deep toothache and stops infection from spreading.</li>
              <li>Saves your natural tooth and keeps nearby teeth from shifting.</li>
              <li>Restores comfortable chewing on both sides of the jaw.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F9FA] p-6 border border-slate-200">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">Aftercare Tips</h2>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Avoid chewing hard foods on the treated tooth until the final cap is placed.</li>
              <li>Take any prescribed pain-relief or antibiotic tablets as directed.</li>
              <li>Brush gently around the tooth and attend your follow-up visit on schedule.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
